Third-party browser bundles (optional card-patch assets)
=======================================================

`assets/card-patches/*.client.js.gz` are MODIFIED builds of two third-party
plugins, produced by this project from their published sources plus a small
registration service that lets a card render content contributed by another
plugin. They are never installed automatically: the settings page's
"Integrations" tab replaces a target's installed bundle only when the user
confirms it, keeps the original as a backup, and can restore it. Upstream
license texts are shipped beside them under `assets/card-patches/licenses/`.

1. dsh-context 0.84.0 and 0.84.1
   https://github.com/bowenliang123/dsh-context
   revisions aa98b1231d5f0f8e833391f198e65e14e73b3323 (0.84.0) and
   d81325ec6bab9dae9bf83e7a866ac74119504e18 (0.84.1)
   Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see
   assets/card-patches/licenses/dsh-context-LICENSE).
   Changes: a new client module registers an optional `contextAgentCardBadges`
   registry, and the shared Agent card renders components registered with it.
   No other behaviour was changed.

2. dsh-better-sidebar 0.32.0 and 0.32.1
   https://github.com/omdsh-dev/DSH-better-sidebar
   tags v0.32.0 and v0.32.1 (commit
   06d21351a50b60063010c178590fc24ecd76fb74)
   Licensed under the MIT License (see
   assets/card-patches/licenses/dsh-better-sidebar-LICENSE).
   Changes: a new client module registers an optional
   `betterSidebarAgentCardBadges` registry, and the tasks graph and tasks tree
   render components registered with it. No other behaviour was changed.
